* British Dual 100 preamp, stage 3 of 3: the tone stack, both channel volumes and the mute. Driven by the V3a cathode follower of stage 2 (node k3a, VK3A).

V VRAIL x 100 450
R Rdummy_x x 0 1G
S VK3A k3a 1 0
C C27 k3a s 22n
C QC20 s tt 470p
C QC19 tt qn19 470p
R QR34 qn19 s 10M
R QR35 s z 33k
R QR36 z f1 68k
R SW4A z f1 1
C QC21 f1 tm 22n
C QC23 f1 f2 22n
R QR37 f2 0 10M
C QC22 f2 wm 22n
R SW4C f2 wm 1
R VR9T tt w9 1
R VR9B w9 tm 1
R VR7 tm tb 1
R VR8T tb wm 1
R VR8B wm 0 1
R QR38 w9 rw 470k
R VR2T rw m2 1
R VR2B m2 0 1
R VR4T rw m4 1
R VR4B m4 0 1
R SW_M2 m2 mute 1
R SW_M4 m4 mute 1e12
R LINKY mute y 1
R QR25 y 0 10M
